---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { support, passes, passChoiceNote, passLengthNote, stackingNote, launchPricingNote, reminderNote, morTermsNote } from '../../data/payment';
import { links } from '../../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with your Rsquared Academy account, access, payments and lessons."
>
  <section class="sec page-head" aria-labelledby="support-h">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Support</span>
      <h1 id="support-h" class="t-h1">Support</h1>
      <p class="t-lead">Email <a href={`mailto:${support.email}`}>{support.email}</a>. Every message is read by a person, and we reply within {support.responseTime} (Monday to Friday, India Standard Time).</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec flush" aria-labelledby="include-h">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <h2 id="include-h" class="t-h3">Please include</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The email address on your account.</li>
        <li>What you were doing and what happened. A screenshot helps.</li>
        <li>For payment questions, the order date and the payment id.</li>
        <li>For lesson or editor problems, your browser and operating system.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="t-h3">Common problems</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>I can't sign in.</strong> Accounts open with the paid courses. If a sign-in email doesn't arrive within 15 minutes, check spam, then write to us.</li>
        <li><strong>I paid but my course is locked.</strong> Access normally starts within a few minutes of payment. If it is not active after 30 minutes, email us with your receipt. See <a href="/delivery/">Delivery and access</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Which pass can I buy?</strong> {passChoiceNote} All three cover all paid tracks. Each is a prepaid, one-time payment with no automatic renewal. Payments in India are processed by Razorpay. {morTermsNote} {passLengthNote} See <a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Can I buy again before my pass ends?</strong> Yes. {stackingNote}</li>
        <li><strong>How does launch pricing work?</strong> {launchPricingNote}</li>
        <li><strong>Will you remind me?</strong> {reminderNote}</li>
        <li><strong>My access has ended.</strong> You can buy any of the three passes again. Your progress is kept. Free courses stay free, and lessons 0–2 of every course stay free to try.</li>
        <li><strong>The code editor does not run.</strong> The editor runs R in your browser. Use a current version of Chrome, Edge, Firefox or Safari, and let the page finish loading the first time.</li>
        <li><strong>I want a refund.</strong> For a {passes.quarterly.exact} or a {passes.annual.exact}, you can ask within 14 days of purchase if you have completed less than 20% of the paid lessons. The {passes.monthly.exact} has no refunds, except a duplicate charge or a technical problem we can't fix. Try lessons 0–2 of every course free before you buy. See the <a href="/refund/">Refund and cancellation policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>I want my data deleted.</strong> Email us with "Privacy" in the subject line. See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> page.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="t-h3">More help</h2>
      <p>For contact details and the postal address, see the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>
      <p>Is the app down for everyone? Check <a href={links.status}>Service status</a>; it shows whether the app, the lessons, R packages and this website are up.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-top: 96px;
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .legal {
    max-width: var(--text-max);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .legal ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 24px;
    list-style: disc;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .flush {
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .page-head {
      padding-block: var(--space-12);
    }
  }
</style>
